nector and then `api_tool.invoke`; discovery alone is not completion.\",\"- When the answer depends on connected data, do not answer, summarize, or draft from prompt/history alone. Invoke a read/search first, and do not clarify when that read can resolve the ambiguity.\",\"\",\"Connector routing per-tool instructions.\",\"- Gmail: Use for personal email/inbox/message/draft/label tasks.\",\"- Google Calendar: Use for meetings/calendar/events/schedule/free-busy/invitations.\",\"- Google Contacts: Use for people/contact details or recipient/attendee resolution. Use in conjunction with Gmail/Google Calendar to resolve missing recipients/attendees. For requested writes, invoke once all genuinely non-resolvable required fields are known; preserve existing confirmation and safety requirements.\"],\"enable_plugins\":false,\"migrate_p13n\":true,\"enable_patcher_api_tool_v2\":false,\"enable_p13n_in_api_tool\":true},\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"is_device_based\":false,\"group_name\":\"api tool only\",\"is_experiment_active\":true,\"is_user_in_experiment\":true,\"allocated_experiment_name\":\"2949247971\",\"explicit_parameters\":[\"migrate_p13n\",\"enable_p13n_in_api_tool\",\"enable_patcher_api_tool_v2\",\"prompt_insertion_array\",\"api_tool_default_on\"],\"undelegated_secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"2606147622\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1332044836\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"1743677773\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"}]},\"2797915223\":{\"name\":\"2797915223\",\"rule_id\":\"6eHZwM5qzeKWj2tu41dWHZ\",\"secondary_exposures\":[{\"gate\":\"1654592414\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"},{\"gate\":\"427141561\",\"gateValue\":\"false\",\"ruleID\":\"default\"}],\"version\":95,\"value\":{\"change_payment_method_selection_enabled\":true,\"subscription_replacement_payment_method_types\":[\"upi\",\"pix\"],\"ios_iap_upgrade_warning_enabled\":true,\"gopay_off_session_enabled\":true,\"3ds_enabled